.* >>PRE-COMPILER<<                                                    *
.*   >>CRTCMD<<  CALL PGM(&LI/PEEK99) PARM(+                           *
.*                        '&SF' '&SL' '&SM' '&LI' '*NO' +              *
.*                        'PEEK' '&LI' '*NO');                         *
.*   >>EXECUTE<<                                                       *
